# Absenta Performance Optimization - Complete Guide

## 🚀 Performance Overview

**Absenta** telah dioptimasi untuk mendukung 150+ concurrent users dengan response time < 2 detik untuk data cached dan < 5 detik untuk data fresh.

## 📊 Performance Metrics

### Current Performance Targets
- **Response Time**: < 2s untuk cached data, < 5s untuk fresh data
- **Concurrent Users**: 150+ users
- **Database Queries**: < 100ms average
- **Memory Usage**: < 512MB per instance
- **Cache Hit Rate**: > 80%

### Performance Monitoring
```javascript
// Performance monitoring utilities
const performanceMonitor = {
  // Track API response times
  trackApiCall: async (endpoint, apiCall) => {
    const start = performance.now();
    try {
      const result = await apiCall();
      const duration = performance.now() - start;
      
      console.log(`API ${endpoint}: ${duration.toFixed(2)}ms`);
      
      // Log slow queries
      if (duration > 1000) {
        console.warn(`Slow API call: ${endpoint} took ${duration.toFixed(2)}ms`);
      }
      
      return result;
    } catch (error) {
      const duration = performance.now() - start;
      console.error(`API ${endpoint} failed after ${duration.toFixed(2)}ms:`, error);
      throw error;
    }
  },
  
  // Track database query performance
  trackQuery: async (query, params, dbCall) => {
    const start = performance.now();
    try {
      const result = await dbCall();
      const duration = performance.now() - start;
      
      if (duration > 100) {
        console.warn(`Slow query (${duration.toFixed(2)}ms):`, query.substring(0, 100));
      }
      
      return result;
    } catch (error) {
      const duration = performance.now() - start;
      console.error(`Query failed after ${duration.toFixed(2)}ms:`, error);
      throw error;
    }
  }
};
```

